sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Tourist as Du khach
    participant Browser as GPS Device
    participant FE as useAutoNarration & useNearbyAudio
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant TransSvc as Translation/TTS Service
    participant SpeechSynth as Web Speech API (Fallback)
    participant Analytics as Analytics Service

    Tourist->>FE: Bat "Thuyet minh tu dong" tren ban do
    loop Du khach di chuyen (watchPosition)
        Browser-->>FE: Cap nhat toa do (lat, lng, accuracy)
        FE->>FE: Tinh khoang cach Haversine toi cac POI
        alt Khoang cach <= ban kinh kich hoat (35m - 60m) va chua phat
            FE->>FE: Ghi nhan vao autoPlayedSetRef, bat cooldown
            alt Co file am thanh may chu (audioStatus == READY)
                FE->>GW: GET /api/tts/audio/poi_{id}_{lang}_{hash}.mp3 (Bearer token)
                GW->>TransSvc: AudioEntitlementFilter kiem tra X-User-Plan
                TransSvc-->>FE: Stream file am thanh MP3
                FE->>Tourist: Phat qua AudioContext & cuon chu theo cau
            else Am thanh may chu chua san sang
                FE->>SpeechSynth: Kich hoat giong doc co san tren thiet bi
                SpeechSynth->>Tourist: Doc to phan thuyet minh van ban
            end
            FE->>GW: POST /api/analytics/events (eventType=AUDIO_PLAY, triggerType=GPS)
            GW->>Analytics: Ghi nhan luot nghe du lich bat dong bo
        end
    end
